        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Mexico City</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1325 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Founded as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tenochtitlan">Tenochtitlan</a> by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mexica">Mexica</a> in 1325 or 1327, on an island in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lake-texcoco">Lake Texcoco</a>; the Spanish razed it in 1521 and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hernan-cortes">Hernán Cortés</a> founded the Spanish colonial capital on the site.</span></div>
