          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mexica">Mexica</a> city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tenochtitlan">Tenochtitlan</a> and its siege and destruction in 1521; the capital of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/viceroyalty-of-new-spain">New Spain</a>; the Zócalo and the Metropolitan Cathedral; the Desagüe, the long effort to drain the valley; the capital of independent <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mexico">Mexico</a>; the muralists; the earthquake of 1985</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Mexico City, officially Ciudad de México or CDMX since 2016, is the capital and largest city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mexico">Mexico</a> and is divided into 16 boroughs.</span></div>
